StringData.data:
You can upgrade skills with GOLD from the Master window (P).
Skills can be upgraded up to 6 times for an increasing GOLD.

{color:#C96B7A}Careful! Skill upgrades only take effect during missions, while PvP skills are upgraded freely in the midst of battle for each individual match.{color:end}

In the Arena, you gain Skill Points over time.
You can use these to upgrade your Skills.

{color:#ECCE58}Tip: Don't forget to spend the Skill Point given at the start of the match!{color:end}

Support Kits are defensive items that are set to trigger when you’re low on health.
You can equip them by checking the Support Kit Tab in the Master Window (P).

{color:#C96B7A}Careful! Support Kits only apply to Stages and Rifts.{color:end}
